title: "L1 Station-Keeping: LQR vs Reinforcement Learning"
abstract: >-
  Station-keeping at the unstable Sun-Earth L1 point in the planar circular
  restricted three-body problem: an LQR baseline compared with DQN and PPO
  agents on identical physics, errors and test seeds.
